 ) 
4. Rf7+ $1 ( 4. Qxd7 $4 Rxc1 { and it’s White that gets mated. } ) 
Kg8 $1 5. Rg7+ $1 Kh8 $1 ( 5... Kf8 6. Nxh7+ { ✔ and the queen is captured with check. } ) 
6. Rxh7+ $1 { Von Bardeleben left the board and didn’t come back. He is lost after: } Kg8 7. Rg7+ $1 Kh8 8. Qh4+ $1 Kxg7 9. Qh7+ Kf8 10. Qh8+ $1 { ✔ } Ke7 11. Qg7+ ( 11. Re1 { is also winning. } ) 
Ke8 12. Qg8+ Ke7 13. Qf7+ Kd8 14. Qf8+ $1 Qe8 15. Nf7+ Kd7 16. Qd6# 
